Interoperability and attribution
--------------------------------

This Software is an independent client that communicates with Hermes Agent over
its publicly observable HTTP/WebSocket API. The client code in this repository
was written independently against that public interface (a clean-room approach).

No source code or visual assets (icons, images, logos) from Hermes Agent, the
Hermes desktop application, or any other Nous Research product are copied into or
distributed with this project. The user interface is an independent reimplementation
in this project's own components — inspired by, not copied from, Hermes' visual language.

